{"seq":1,"slug":"choosing-components","title":"选择目标维数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/choosing-components","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"选择目标维数\">选择目标维数</h1><p>&quot;降到几维&quot;听起来像个细节，实则是降维里最该被论证、却最常被随手拍板的决定。降到二维只是为画图时的特例；多数时候降维是为下游模型服务，目标维数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 本身就是一个需要数据支撑的超参数。选大了，冗余和噪声没去干净；选小了，把有用信号一起丢了。本篇集中讲累计解释方差、碎石图、交叉验证三类定维方法，并说清&quot;为可视化选维&quot;和&quot;为建模选维&quot;为何遵循不同逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>定维方法可以归为三条思路：看保留了多少方差、看曲线的拐点、看下游任务的表现。它们的可靠性与适用场景各不相同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[要降到 k 维] --&gt; B{为了什么?}&#10;  B --&gt; C[为可视化]&#10;  B --&gt; D[为下游建模]&#10;  C --&gt; E[k 固定为 2 或 3&lt;br/&gt;无需选择]&#10;  D --&gt; F[看累计解释方差]&#10;  D --&gt; G[看碎石图肘部]&#10;  D --&gt; H[把 k 当超参&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证]&#10;  F --&gt; I[选定 k]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[要降到 k 维] --&gt; B{为了什么?}\n  B --&gt; C[为可视化]\n  B --&gt; D[为下游建模]\n  C --&gt; E[k 固定为 2 或 3&lt;br/&gt;无需选择]\n  D --&gt; F[看累计解释方差]\n  D --&gt; G[看碎石图肘部]\n  D --&gt; H[把 k 当超参&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证]\n  F --&gt; I[选定 k]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累计解释方差阈值</td>\n<td>保住 90%/95% 方差</td>\n<td>PCA/SVD</td>\n<td>中（阈值主观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碎石图肘部</td>\n<td>特征值骤降的拐点</td>\n<td>PCA/SVD</td>\n<td>中（拐点常模糊）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉验证</td>\n<td>下游指标最优</td>\n<td>任意方法</td>\n<td>高（直接对齐目标）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"累计解释方差-保住百分之多少\">累计解释方差：保住百分之多少</h2><p>对 <a href=\"../linear-methods/pca\">PCA</a> 这类按方差排序的方法，最直接的依据是累计解释方差——把前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个主成分的方差占比累加，选一个让它达到目标阈值（常用 90%、95%、99%）的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^* = \\min\\left\\{ k : \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\lambda_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{d}\\lambda_j} \\ge \\tau \\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0648em;vertical-align:-1.3148em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6787em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3148em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实务上有个便利写法：scikit-learn 的 <code>PCA(n_components=0.95)</code> 直接传保留比例，自动解出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。这种做法简单透明，但阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是主观的——95% 没有任何理论神圣性。更稳妥的是把阈值当起点，再结合下游验证微调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碎石图-找特征值的拐点\">碎石图：找特征值的拐点</h2><p>碎石图（scree plot）把特征值按序画成折线，找那个&quot;陡降转平缓&quot;的肘部——肘部之后的成分方差很小，多半是噪声。这是 1966 年 Raymond Cattell 提出的经典启发法，直觉是：信号成分的方差显著大于噪声成分，二者之间会有一道台阶。</p>\n<p>它的麻烦是肘部常常并不干净——曲线平滑下降时，拐点见仁见智。一个更可重复的变体是 Kaiser 准则：只保留特征值大于 1（即方差超过单个标准化原始特征）的成分，但它在维度很高时容易高估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。还有更严谨的并行分析（parallel analysis）：把真实特征值和随机数据的特征值比较，只保留显著高于随机的成分。可靠性递增，复杂度也递增。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交叉验证-让下游任务说话\">交叉验证：让下游任务说话</h2><p>前两类方法都只看降维本身，不看你最终要干什么。但目标维数的好坏，归根结底由下游任务决定——既然如此，最可靠的做法就是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 当成一个普通超参数，扔进交叉验证里挑。</p>\n<p>具体做法：把&quot;降维 + 下游模型&quot;封成一条流水线，对一组候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（如 5、10、20、50）做交叉验证，选下游指标（分类准确率、回归误差、聚类轮廓系数等）最优的那个。这直接对齐了真正的目标，绕开了&quot;保住多少方差才够&quot;的主观争论。代价是计算量大，且<strong>必须在每折内部重新拟合降维</strong>，否则会发生数据泄漏——这是初学者最常踩的坑，专门在 <a href=\"pipelines-pitfalls\">流水线与常见陷阱</a> 里展开。对非线性方法（如自编码器），由于没有解释方差概念，交叉验证几乎是唯一可靠的定维途径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为可视化选维-根本不是同一个问题\">为可视化选维：根本不是同一个问题</h2><p>前面的讨论默认了&quot;降维服务于建模&quot;。但若目的是可视化，整个逻辑就变了：目标维数被人眼的感知能力锁死在 2 或 3，根本没得选。这时该问的不再是&quot;几维&quot;，而是&quot;用哪种方法把这 2 维做得最忠实&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诉求</th>\n<th>决定的是</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>用哪种嵌入做 2–3 维</td>\n<td><a href=\"../manifold-learning/tsne\">t-SNE</a> / <a href=\"../manifold-learning/umap\">UMAP</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建模</td>\n<td>降到几维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>累计方差 / 交叉验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这两件事混为一谈是常见错误：有人用累计解释方差给一张可视化图&quot;证明&quot;二维够用，但 t-SNE、UMAP 根本没有解释方差这个量；也有人用 t-SNE 给建模降维，却忘了它几乎不可外推、维度也上不去。先想清楚自己属于哪类诉求（回到 <a href=\"../foundations/why-reduce-dimensions\">为什么降维</a>），再选定维方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个实用的决策流程\">一个实用的决策流程</h2><p>把上面综合成一条可操作的路径：先明确诉求——若为可视化，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 定为 2/3，重心转向选方法；若为建模，先用累计解释方差或碎石图圈出一个候选范围（如 10–50），再用交叉验证在这个范围内精选，最后用下游指标确认。这个&quot;先粗筛方差、后精调验证&quot;的两步法，兼顾了效率与可靠性，避免了纯靠主观阈值或纯靠暴力搜索的两个极端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>目标维数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是需要论证的超参数，不该随手拍板。</li>\n<li><strong>累计解释方差</strong>：选保住 90%/95% 方差的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，简单但阈值主观。</li>\n<li><strong>碎石图肘部</strong>：找特征值骤降的拐点，拐点常模糊；并行分析更严谨。</li>\n<li><strong>交叉验证</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 当超参、用下游指标选，最可靠，但须防每折内的数据泄漏。</li>\n<li>非线性方法无解释方差，定维基本只能靠交叉验证。</li>\n<li><strong>为可视化选维是另一个问题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 锁定在 2/3，重心转向选哪种嵌入方法。</li>\n<li>实用流程：粗筛方差圈范围 → 交叉验证精选 → 下游指标确认。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选择目标维数","id":"选择目标维数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"累计解释方差：保住百分之多少","id":"累计解释方差-保住百分之多少"},{"level":2,"text":"碎石图：找特征值的拐点","id":"碎石图-找特征值的拐点"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉验证：让下游任务说话","id":"交叉验证-让下游任务说话"},{"level":2,"text":"为可视化选维：根本不是同一个问题","id":"为可视化选维-根本不是同一个问题"},{"level":2,"text":"一个实用的决策流程","id":"一个实用的决策流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自编码器嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/manifold-learning/autoencoder-embeddings"},"next":{"title":"可视化与解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/visualization-interpretation"}}